<title>USA: AccuMed offering priced at $4.50/share.</title>
<headline>AccuMed offering priced at $4.50/share.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>AccuMed International Inc said a three million share common stock offering was priced at $4.50 per share.</p>
<p>Underwriters have an option to buy up to 450,000 additional shares to cover overallotments.  </p>
<p>It said Vector Securities International Inc and Tucker Anthony Inc managed the offering.</p>
<p>Net proceeds from the offering will go to fund research and development activities, to scale up manufacturing for AccuMed's Cytopathology product (for screening cell segments), for acquisitions and working capital requirements.</p>
<p>AccuMed is a laboratory diagnostic products company.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
